*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% 43 A + 43 Leitz-prefixed B media aliases (86 profiles). Source-specific geometry preserved; hardware verification incomplete.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.4.1"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "LEITZICO.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Leitz"
*Product: "(Leitz Icon)"
*ModelName: "Leitz Icon USB"
*ShortNickName: "Leitz Icon USB"
*NickName: "Leitz Icon - 86 Media Profiles (experimental)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*Throughput: "1"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 leitz-rastertoicon"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-command 0 leitz-command"
*cupsCommands: "ReportStatus"
*% The printer has no verified hardware copy-generation command.
*% The upstream CUPS RIP must produce complete raster pages for each copy.
*cupsManualCopies: True
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Continuous70030001
@LEITZ_PAGE_SIZE@
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Continuous70030001
@LEITZ_PAGE_REGION@
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: Continuous70030001
@LEITZ_IMAGEABLE_AREA@
*DefaultPaperDimension: Continuous70030001
@LEITZ_PAPER_DIMENSION@
*HWMargins: 9.600 3.600 9.600 3.600
*VariablePaperSize: True
*MaxMediaWidth: "258.000"
*MaxMediaHeight: "7680.000"
*MinMediaWidth: "26.000"
*MinMediaHeight: "14.000"
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 26.000 258.000
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 14.000 7680.000
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0
*OpenUI *LabelCutter/Cut Between Labels: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 13 AnySetup *LabelCutter
*DefaultLabelCutter: ON
*LabelCutter ON/Cut Each Label: ""
*LabelCutter OFF/Cut At Job End (experimental): ""
*CloseUI: *LabelCutter
*OpenUI *LeitzProtocol/Print Protocol (development): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 12 AnySetup *LeitzProtocol
*DefaultLeitzProtocol: Auto
*LeitzProtocol Auto/Automatic (Current, then Native): ""
*LeitzProtocol Current/Current: ""
*LeitzProtocol Native/Native: ""
*CloseUI: *LeitzProtocol
*OpenUI *LeitzCutMode/Cut Length: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 11 AnySetup *LeitzCutMode
*DefaultLeitzCutMode: Automatic
*LeitzCutMode Automatic/Automatic cut: ""
*LeitzCutMode Content/Force cut after last ink (roll only, experimental): ""
*LeitzCutMode Page/Cut at selected page length (use a custom size for continuous rolls): ""
*CloseUI: *LeitzCutMode
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300x600dpi
*Resolution 300x600dpi/300 x 600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 600]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 300x300dpi/300 x 300 dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Black
*ColorModel Black/Black and White: "<</cupsColorSpace 3 /cupsBitsPerColor 1 /cupsBitsPerPixel 1>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray8/8-bit Grayscale (driver dither): "<</cupsColorSpace 3 /cupsBitsPerColor 8 /cupsBitsPerPixel 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel
*OpenUI *LeitzDither/Grayscale Rendering: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 21 AnySetup *LeitzDither
*DefaultLeitzDither: Bayer4
*LeitzDither Bayer4/Ordered 4x4 Bayer: ""
*LeitzDither Threshold/Black/White Threshold: ""
*CloseUI: *LeitzDither
